# Behavior Debugger — environment
#
# Copy to `.env` and adjust. All values have working defaults; the app runs
# with zero configuration and zero API keys.

# ── HTTP ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Port for the API and dashboard.
PORT=4317

# ── Storage ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Where events and state live. Relocated by the tests for isolation.
# Defaults to <repo>/.data
# BEHAVIOR_DEBUGGER_HOME=./.data

# ── Demo timing ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Multiplies WAIT durations. 1 = real time (a sparse session waits ~4 minutes).
# 0.05 = 20× faster, for demos. This changes the DELAY only — the persisted
# `waitUntil` is always the real deadline, so scaling cannot alter what the
# system believes.
# WAIT_TIME_SCALE=1

# ── Optional LLM narration ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The product runs fully without these. When set, a provider may PHRASE the
# narrative — it never chooses a verdict, a confidence, or a hypothesis.
# `guardNarrative()` rejects causal claims ("the root cause is", "proves that").
#
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai-compatible
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# LLM_API_KEY=
# LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
